  "description": "For ten days straight since moving in, Min-seok has been forced to listen to the sounds of his next-door neighbor’s affairs day and night. Unable to endure it any longer, he finally pounds on the wall.\n\nThe sudden silence from next door feels satisfying, and Min-seok tries to refocus on his work, until he hears a voice strike back…?!\n\n*“So… you’re saying you want to do it with me now?”*",
